{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1944158836"}, "name":{"label":"Arindam_2401"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-12T10:18:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.5"}, "id":{"label":"14294899349"}, "title":{"label":"Issue with Boat Hearables"}, "content":{"label":"Today I bought boat rockerz 255pro +. It is connected to my iPhone seamlessly but the software has failed to recognise the device. I charged up the set fully and tried several times but always it failed to recognise the device even though the I am unable to add the device manually. There is no preset found on listed devices named Rockerz 255 pro +. Please look into it", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1592550875&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/reviews/id1916404752"}, "name":{"label":"ArbaazChauhan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-12T08:32:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.7.5"}, "id":{"label":"14294550311"}, "title":{"label":"Unauthorized Bluetooth Connection Issue with boAt Rockerz 255 Pro+"}, "content":{"label":"Dear boAt Support Team,\n\nI recently purchased a boAt Rockerz 255 Pro+ neckband and am facing a serious Bluetooth connectivity issue.\n\nWhile I am connected to my device, nearby users are sometimes able to connect to the neckband automatically without my permission. When this happens, my audio playback stops, and I can hear audio or voice from the other user’s device. This raises concerns regarding both privacy and security.\n\nI have also installed the boAt Hearables iOS app, but Rockerz 255 Pro+ does not appear in the list of supported devices, so I am unable to manage any connection or pairing settings through the app.\n\nCould you please help me with the following:\n\nHow can I prevent unauthorized devices from connecting to my neckband?\nIs there a way to make the device private or require permission before pairing?\nIs there any firmware update available to resolve this issue?\nIf this is a hardware or firmware defect, what are the available replacement or warranty options?\nI have already tried resetting and reconnecting the device, but the issue persists.\n\nI would appreciate your assistance in resolving this matter as soon as possible.\n\nThank you.\n\nBest regards,\nArabaz Ahamad", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/in/review?id=1592550875&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
